title: Door3AInside
---
// Talk target just inside Samantha's door (Hotspots layer). He leaves 3A only when she
// sees him out.
<<if $chapter == "R1Thu1" and not $gate_r1_thu1_sit>>
    {$samantha_name}: Leaving already? Dinner's nearly ready.
<<elseif $chapter == "R1Thu1" and not $gate_r1_thu1_dishes>>
    {$samantha_name}: The sink's over there. Dishes first, then you can go.
<<elseif $chapter == "R1Thu2" and not $gate_r1_thu2_dinner>>
    {$samantha_name}: You've only just got here.
<<elseif $chapter == "R1Thu2" and not $gate_r1_thu2_stand>>
    {$samantha_name}: I said stand there. Not leave.
<<endif>>
===
